     *   domain        – public issuer/browser URL of your Zitadel instance, e.g. https://auth.example.com
     *   backchannelDomain - optional server-to-server URL used from PHP containers
     *   backchannelHostHeader - optional Host header for reverse proxies such as Traefik
     *   clientId      – Client ID of the PKCE application created in Zitadel
     *   clientSecret  – Client Secret (leave empty for public PKCE apps)
     *   callbackUrl   - Full backend URL to /api/auth/zitadel/callback on this instance
